1. build-agent, from Anthropic's Small Business plugin (commit 5e504ae), in references/build-agent/. Changed for
   Builder: build-agent.md (its SKILL.md, renamed) and skill_authoring.md no longer register a skill with that
   plugin's router, which Builder does not have. Each says so in its first line. capture.md and gotchas.md are
   unchanged.

2. skill-creator, from Anthropic's skills repository (commit e4bb5d9), in references/skill-creator/. Unchanged, except
   that its SKILL.md is renamed skill-creator.md, so the builder folder holds one SKILL.md and Builder does not stand in
   for the skill-creator your AI app may already have. Its licence file is the same licence, given once in
   LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.

